    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT : 250ms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250ms refers to the average human reaction speed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bd</strong>Use the arrow keys or WASD keys to control your character.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img].<br><br>Enemies will briefly turn green for 250 ms, after which you can click the mouse to destroy them. Destroy all enemies to progress to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bd</strong>Test your skills against various types of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bd</strong>Try to complete the game with as few deaths as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img].</p>",
